; DNS backup for clickindicatorsmod.com
; Captured 2026-08-13 from the Cloudflare dashboard before the zone delete/re-add.
; BIND format - importable via Cloudflare DNS > Import.
; TTL 1 == "Auto" in the Cloudflare UI.
;
; PROXY STATUS IS NOT CARRIED BY BIND IMPORT. After importing, set:
;   clickindicatorsmod.com  A  192.0.2.1  -> PROXIED (orange cloud)
;   everything else                        -> DNS ONLY (grey cloud)
;
; Workers Routes to recreate after the zone is re-added:
;   clickindicatorsmod.com/*      -> autumn-paper-2321
;   clickindicatorsmod.com/api/*  -> clickindicators-api

clickindicatorsmod.com.	1	IN	A	192.0.2.1
clickindicatorsmod.com.	1	IN	MX	10 mx2.privateemail.com.
clickindicatorsmod.com.	1	IN	MX	10 mx1.privateemail.com.
send.send.clickindicatorsmod.com.	3600	IN	MX	10 feedback-smtp.us-east-1.amazonses.com.
clickindicatorsmod.com.	1	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 include:spf.privateemail.com ~all"
resend._domainkey.send.clickindicatorsmod.com.	3600	IN	TXT	"p=MIGfMA0GCSqGSIb3DQEBAQUAA4GNADCBiQKBgQDWd3eHdhezRwNGUDd3pWpixN8z+Fq84DF2yW7A2mT9JXqE8AKUfJooTGUOIv9/ZIxutT1Xctq8mYyE9Y7/FGkFW5ALiMSUM8lkTegRTAAstgZcDJaTM6KP80JqMLRIFH1NifvxQV/bLSWPb8SFitIbeoa5BvX8mOV9gre6X/RBkwIDAQAB"
send.send.clickindicatorsmod.com.	3600	IN	TXT	"v=spf1 include:amazonses.com ~all"
